<title>USA: MCI steps up bid for Ariz. local service.</title>
<headline>MCI steps up bid for Ariz. local service.</headline>
<dateline>PHOENIX, Ariz. 1996-08-30</dateline>
<text>
<p>MCI Communications Corp said it has asked Arizona state regulators to break a logjam in talks with U.S. West Communications Group, over MCI's attempt to enter the local telephone market in that state.</p>
<p>MCI said at issue in the dispute is the inability of U.S. West and MCI to resolve issues concering the interconnection, unbundled network elements, interim local number portability tariffs and resale wholesale rates.</p>
</text>
